---
import { CTA_URL, RISK_LEVELS, SCORE_VALUES, TOTAL_QUESTIONS } from '../../data/stopbang';
---

<section id="sb-result" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite" class="scroll-mt-6 outline-none">
    <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-100 shadow-sm bg-white">

        <div class="relative bg-linear-to-br from-white via-somno/5 to-somno-light/20 px-6 sm:px-10 pt-10 pb-12 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-16 w-80 h-80 bg-somno-light/25 rounded-full blur-[110px] pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-somno/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

            <div class="relative">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-somno-dark mb-3">Tu resultado</p>

                <div class="flex items-end gap-3">
                    <span id="sb-score" class="text-8xl sm:text-9xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-none tabular-nums text-somno">0</span>
                    <span class="pb-2 sm:pb-4 text-2xl text-slate-400 font-light">de {TOTAL_QUESTIONS}</span>
                </div>

                <p id="sb-level-name" class="mt-4 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900"></p>

                <div class="mt-10" role="img" aria-label="Posición de tu puntaje en la escala de 0 a 8">
                    <div class="relative">
                        <div class="flex gap-1">
                            {
                                RISK_LEVELS.map((r) => (
                                    <div
                                        data-seg={r.id}
                                        class={`h-3 rounded-full transition-opacity duration-700 opacity-40 ${r.solid}`}
                                        style={`width:${((r.max - r.min + 1) / SCORE_VALUES) * 100}%`}
                                    />
                                ))
                            }
                        </div>
                        <div
                            id="sb-marker"
                            class="absolute -top-2 -bottom-2 w-1.5 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-slate-800 shadow-[0_0_0_3px_white,0_4px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.35)] transition-[left] duration-1000 ease-out"
                            style="left:0%"
                        >
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-3 flex gap-1 text-xs text-slate-400 font-light">
                        {
                            RISK_LEVELS.map((r) => (
                                <span style={`width:${((r.max - r.min + 1) / SCORE_VALUES) * 100}%`}>{r.range}</span>
                            ))
                        }
                    </div>

                    <p id="sb-combined-note" hidden class="mt-5 flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-md">
                        <i class="fas fa-circle-info mt-0.5 text-somno"></i>
                        Tu puntaje está en un rango menor, pero la combinación de tus respuestas cumple los criterios de alto riesgo.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {
            RISK_LEVELS.map((r) => (
                <div data-level-panel={r.id} hidden class="p-6 sm:p-10">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter text-slate-900 leading-tight max-w-2xl">
                        {r.titulo}
                    </h3>
                    <p data-desc={r.desc} class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                        {r.desc}
                    </p>

                    <div class={`mt-8 border-l-4 p-4 rounded-r-2xl max-w-2xl ${r.soft}`}>
                        <p class={`text-sm leading-relaxed ${r.softText}`}>{r.nota}</p>
                    </div>

                    <a
                        href={CTA_URL}
                        class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-linear-to-r from-somno to-somno-light text-white font-bold shadow-xl shadow-somno/30 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-somno/40 transition-all focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-somno"
                    >
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i>
                        {r.ctaTexto}
                    </a>
                </div>
            ))
        }

        <div class="px-6 sm:px-10 pb-10">
            <button
                type="button"
                id="sb-reset"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl cursor-pointer border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 font-semibold hover:border-somno/40 hover:text-somno transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-somno"
            >
                <i class="fas fa-rotate-left"></i>
                Realizar de nuevo
            </button>

            <div class="mt-8 bg-somno/5 border-l-4 border-somno p-4 rounded-r-2xl">
                <div class="flex gap-3">
                    <i class="fas fa-shield-halved text-somno mt-0.5 text-sm shrink-0"></i>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
                        Este resultado es una herramienta de <strong class="text-slate-700">tamizaje</strong>, no un diagnóstico. Solo un especialista puede interpretarlo junto con tu historia clínica.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>